   "daf": "57a",
   "sentenceId": 13,
   "he": "וַחֲכָמִים אוֹמְרִים לֹא אָמְרוּ וְכוּ׳. אִיתְּמַר, רַב הוּנָא אָמַר: נוֹתְנִין קַרְפֵּף לָזוֹ וְקַרְפֵּף לָזוֹ. חִיָּיא בַּר רַב אָמַר: קַרְפֵּף [אֶחָד] לִשְׁתֵּיהֶן.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna: «And the Rabbis say: They spoke» of the addition of a karpef «only» with regard to the space between two adjacent cities. «It was stated» that the amora’im disagreed with regard to this issue. «Rav Huna said: One allocates a karpef to this» city «and a karpef to that» city, so that the two cities together are granted a total of slightly more than 141 cubits. «Ḥiyya bar Rav said:» One allocates only «one» common «karpef to the two of them.»"
  }
